      "notes": "Search-fallback branch, used only when Catalog has no product_url for this item/store. Brave Search API chosen for its simple single-header-auth REST shape; swap providers here if preferred \u2014 nothing downstream depends on Brave specifically. Expect a materially higher extraction failure/mismatch rate than the known-URL branch (see Validate Extraction's notes)."
